.TH QUIPU-ALIGN-EXPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-align\-export \- Export a mapping set as standard SSSOM TSV or RDF Turtle
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu align export\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-license\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-author\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIset.tsv\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a mapping set as standard SSSOM TSV or RDF Turtle
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-license\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-author\-prefix\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIset.tsv\fR>

